        <p>DEATH OF AN EX-COCrNCILLOR.</p>
        <p>Mr. Charles Edward Barlow, who has died at Prenton Birkenhead, aged sixty-six, formerly resided at Widnes, and for twelve years represented Farnworth Ward on the Town Council. He was well-known in the chemical industry, and was also a staunch Churchman and Con- servative.</p>
